      "quote": "This review used the PECO (Population, Exposure, Comparison and Outcomes) approach to research, with the following parameters: Population: Pregnant, labouring, or postpartum women up to 42 days after delivery in Africa. Exposure: factors predictive of MNM, such as factors related to the prenatal period (presence of a prenatal visit and frequency of prenatal visit), sociodemographic characteristics and delay in access to care. Comparison: reference group reported for each predictive factor in each respective study. Outcome: occurrence of MNM in women.",
